==== (c) m = i - 2j, order m,i,k (j determined) ====
  constraints with the equality m = ... added as two rows  (vars: m i j k )
    i >= 0
    -i + 99 >= 0
    j >= 0
    i - j + 99 >= 0
    -i - j + k >= 0
    -i - j - k + 99 >= 0
